Z||000000||GTFiero1||11-30-2001||10:28 PM||||howhas them. if ya dont you should all get one. They are fun!!! Since they are spring powered and shoo plastic BB's you can have wars with other people as long as you have a face mask (i have had too many close calls). Sure they hurt like hell when you get hit by them and they leave a welt but thats the fun part right? you can get em off e-bay. just search: BB Gun  . There are diffent classes. I have two guns and two classes. One is a basic. It has no Hop Up (hop up puts a spinn on the BB so its more accurate) Its not a heavy weight( heavy weights are the weight of a real gun) and a 15 shot clip (yes they have clips like a real gun). You have to pull back the slide before each shot. this one in in-operably do to when i took it apart, a rubber plug lunched out and i cant find it. Now there is the one i got today. It is an Electric blowback (you dont pull back the slide) But i wouldnt recomend and electric blowback for a first gun though or you will get a bad impression of airsoft guns (the Electric blowback ones are weaker). Best of all they are completely legal in every stste and look just like a real gun!<P>------------------<BR>Adam J. B.<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_3.jpg">   <BR>you gotta keep on keepin on...<BR>IM AOL: GTFiero &  Rumpdetective (dont ask)||||reg||1
